{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000025700","bookName":"Mi destino siempre fuiste tú (Doblado)","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000025700/42000025700.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":2703080,"followCount":72628,"introduction":"Carola García se divorcia de su frío y rico esposo Leo García, tras un matrimonio por contrato de tres años. Pero luego descubre que está embarazada y que es la heredera perdida de la rica familia Muñoz con seis hermanos mayores. Mientras Carola comienza su nueva vida, su exesposo celoso empieza a perseguirla. La falsa heredera de los Muñoz se niega a dejar el protagonismo, y el caos sigue a Carola. El amor y la familia nunca han sido tan complicados... ni tan divertidos.","chapterCount":52,"labels":["Second Chance","Love After Marriage"],"tags":["Second Chance","Love After Marriage"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Mi-destino-siempre-fuiste-tú-Doblado","bookNameLower":"mi-destino-siempre-fuiste-tú-doblado","shelfTime":"2026-08-30 10:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-30 10:00:00","performerList":[{"performerId":"12026","performerName":"Erin Orcutt","performerFormatName":"Erin-Orcutt","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/6x2/12026/12026.jpg?time=1787897461106","videoCount":13},{"performerId":"12261","performerName":"Shay Dinneen","performerFormatName":"Shay-Dinneen","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/1x6/12261/12261.jpg?time=1787897461360","videoCount":9}],"performerIdList":[12026,12261]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701528782","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/28/0x0/00x7/007x5/00752000024/701528782_1/701528782.720p.wz.h264.mp4?Expires=1795222800&Signature=KNbIOw2zLbVAG2NkVlPWdZ2oxTyl1HiBMd7cCEzEqVuko2HZC2IHVqF6ZELabf1KOhgVz9K9OboYAgk5qzCwQtrPV5L1BINmfVjC4